OL,3,GNEWSABar's licence suspended after
OL,4,Acocaine discoveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Market Rasen bar has had its licence
OL,7,Fsuspended for three months after
OL,8,Fevidence of cocaine was repeatedly
OL,9,Ffound there.
OL,11,FWest Lindsey District Council's
OL,12,Flicensing subcommittee heard on
OL,13,FThursday that Lincolnshire Police
OL,14,Fofficers had repeatedly found high
OL,15,Fcocaine readings in the venue, and they
OL,16,Fsaid the owner had ignored a litany of
OL,17,Fproblems for months.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
