OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1792862707
OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABar's licence suspended after
OL,4,Acocaine discoveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Moorhouse, the owner of Buzz Bar
OL,7,Fon Queen Street, said he had been
OL,8,Funable to devote much time to the bar
OL,9,Fdue to ill health, and previous staff
OL,10,Fhad let him down.
OL,12,FThe subcommittee said it was "extremely
OL,13,Fconcerned about repeated high drug
OL,14,Fitemiser readings, with no demonstrated
OL,15,Fmeasures to address this".
